#: of pwnlib.libcdb.download_libraries:15
msgid ""
"Optional additional Debian-style apt mirror prefix(es) to try after the "
"libc.rip URL. Useful when the official mirror has dropped older "
"vulnerable libc versions: each candidate URL is re-tried with everything "
"before ``/pool/`` swapped for the mirror prefix. Mirrors can also be "
"supplied via the ``PWNLIB_EXTRA_LIBC_MIRRORS`` environment variable as a "
"comma- or whitespace-separated list. Example: pass "
"``\"https://debian.sipwise.com/debian-security\"`` to find ``GLIBC "
"2.36-9+deb12u6`` after the official Debian mirrors removed it."
msgstr ""

